<title>SWITZERLAND: Landis &amp; Gyr gets 35 mln SFR Taiwan order.</title>
<headline>Landis &amp; Gyr gets 35 mln SFR Taiwan order.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Landis &amp; Gyr Communications said it had received an order worth over 35 million Swiss francs to provide optical phonecards to the Telecommunications Administration of Taiwan (DGT).</p>
<p>The order is due to be completed by June 1997.</p>
<p>The company is part of Zug-based Landis &amp; Gyr electronics group, which is majority-owned by Elektrowatt AG. Elektrowatt is in turn 44.9-percent owned by conglomerate CS Holding.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
